      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Add a custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a> to the composite converter using the given <a href=\"../RedisSerializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializer</code></a> to use\nSpring Data Redis' <a href=\"../RedisSerializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializer</code></a> for specific serializers such.",
      "translation": "向组合转换器添加自定义的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>，使用给定的<a href=\"../RedisSerializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializer</code></a>来利用 Spring Data Redis 的特定序列化器（如<code>RedisSerializer</code>）进行序列化。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure the default <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/util/MimeType.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.util\"><code>MimeType</code></a> that is provieded through\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/DefaultContentTypeResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>DefaultContentTypeResolver</code></a> to message converters when using\n<a href=\"../RedisMessageConverters.Builder.html#registerDefaults(boolean)\"><code>default registrations</code></a>.",
      "translation": "配置通过 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/util/MimeType.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.util\"><code>MimeType</code></a> 提供的默认 MIME 类型，以便在使用 <a href=\"../RedisMessageConverters.Builder.html#registerDefaults(boolean)\"><code>default registrations</code></a> 时，<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/DefaultContentTypeResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>DefaultContentTypeResolver</code></a> 能够将其提供给消息转换器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a> by applying the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>builder consumer</code></a> a <a href=\"../RedisMessageConverters.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisMessageConverters.Builder</code></a>\ninstance.",
      "translation": "通过应用给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>builder consumer</code></a>，基于一个<a href=\"../RedisMessageConverters.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisMessageConverters.Builder</code></a>实例创建一个新的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/StringMessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>StringMessageConverter</code></a> with the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/charset/Charset.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio.charset\"><code>Charset</code></a>.",
      "translation": "配置一个使用给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/charset/Charset.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio.charset\"><code>Charset</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/StringMessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>StringMessageConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
